         Welcome to Devpit

         A pit stop for your dev machine. A toolkit for Windows developers: the right
         account in every folder, disk space back, stuck ports freed, tools updated and big
         folders moved between PCs, from one menu.

          ✓ Nothing is deleted without a preview and an explicit confirmation.
          ✓ The default answer on every confirmation is No.
          ✓ Nothing leaves this machine unless you turn usage stats on.

          Let's go →




